    betaKanal: "Beta channel", betaKanalPod: "Early versions for enthusiasts – new features sooner, but they may have bugs. Nothing installs by itself. Turning it off returns you to the stable channel: you stay on your current version until the stable one is the same or newer.", posodobitevNaBetiPod: "The beta channel is off: you stay on this version until the stable one is the same or newer. Nothing is replaced with an older version.", posodobitevNajnovejsaBetaPod: "Beta channel: Safeer OS checks stable and beta versions every few hours. Press to check again.", posodobitve: "Updates", posodobitevNajnovejsa: "Up to date ({v})", posodobitevNajnovejsaPod: "Safeer OS checks safeer.si itself every few hours. Press to check again.", posodobitevNaVoljo: "Available: {opis}", posodobitevNaVoljoPod: "Press to download and install – the system will ask for your password.", posodobitevNaVoljoFlatpak: "Press to download and install.", posodobitevRocnoPod: "Press to open safeer.si with the downloads.", posodobitevAppImagePod: "The new version is available as a Flatpak or .deb (no AppImage for now). Press to open safeer.si with the downloads.", posodobitevPreverjam: "Checking safeer.si…", posodobitevPrenasam: "Downloading {ime}… {odstotek} %", posodobitevNamescam: "Installing… (enter your password if the system asks)", posodobitevKoncano: "Installed: {opis}. The new version starts with the next launch of Safeer OS.", posodobitevNapaka: "The update did not go through: {napaka}", posodobitevDomPod: "Open Settings and install it with one press.", predajaStikalo: "Playback for other devices", predajaStikaloPod: "A phone, tablet or TV may ask what is playing here, continue it there and send you what it is watching.", zaupajRacunalniku: "Trust this computer", zaupajDa: "The connection stays after signing out and restarting.", zaupajNe: "The connection lasts until you sign out – you'll connect again next time you sign in to the computer.", samozagon: "Start when I sign in", samozagonPod